      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.quick-decision",
      "id": "quick-decision",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "直接判断：核心不是只做历史研究，而是把史料与解释转成课程、讨论、评价和研究指导。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "history-teachers-postsecondary.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-profile-25112500"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "可观察信号：愿意核引文、比较冲突证据、解释不确定性并给出可复核反馈。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "history-teachers-postsecondary.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-profile-25112500"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "安全体验使用H-20虚构史料，只做纸面来源比较，不接触真实学生或档案。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "history-teachers-postsecondary.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-history-guidance"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "输出证据表、表面时长差异说明、可支持结论与仍需补证的内容。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "history-teachers-postsecondary.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-history-guidance"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
