          "id": "history-teachers-postsecondary.path.career-path-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-history-guidance"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "材料A：虚构1910年5月3日日记写“早6点听厂铃，晚5点离开”；材料B：虚构1910年5月工资册摘要写“每周6天、每天10小时”。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "history-teachers-postsecondary.path.career-path-block.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-history-guidance"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "任务：分别标注材料类型、作者或形成主体、日期、可支持信息；比较表面时长，并列出在场区间、净工时、计薪小时和对象对应关系的未知项。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "history-teachers-postsecondary.path.career-path-block.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-history-guidance"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "参考答案：A只支持该日从6点到17点的个人记述，表面在场区间为11小时；B只支持工资册所记每天10小时，可能是计薪或净工时。两者有1小时表面差异，但休息、记账定义以及是否对应同一对象均未知，因此尚不能确认矛盾，也不能外推所有工人的真实工时。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "history-teachers-postsecondary.path.career-path-block.5",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-history-guidance"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "仍需核对日记作者身份、工资册对象、在场与计薪口径、休息是否计入、制度执行、更多日期和其他独立材料。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "history-teachers-postsecondary.path.career-path-block.6",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-history-guidance"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
